{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Explosive_Combat.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Enemy_as_weapon_GIF_optimized.gif?t=1730137240\" />In In this 2D pixel art hack-n-slash, your enemies aren't just obstacles\u2014they're your weapons! Toss explosive foes into the fray to create chaotic chain reactions and take out multiple enemies at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Power_up___Progress.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Upgrade_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />The further you go, the stronger you get! Collect power-ups and upgrades to enhance your character's abilities, giving you a better shot at reaching new levels of chaos. How far can you push your luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Bosses_with_a_Twist.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Boss_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />Test your skills against a series of entertaining and funny bosses. Each boss provides a unique challenge, designed to push your abilities while keeping the action light-hearted and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Quirky_Characters.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Dialogue_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />Encounter a cast of eccentric characters, each with their own unique personalities. Whether they\u2019re helping or hindering you, these characters add a dash of humor and unpredictability to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Laugh_out_loud.png?t=1730137240\" />With its comical twist on traditional action games, this game doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect plenty of laughs as you navigate through its explosive, unpredictable world.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"As expected\u2026","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/dfdc45dad37606825e42ea4421a86429bb74a26f.jpg"},{"name":"Who let the sharks out?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/7000f70856b35196a8e34506b4e5323528a1102d.jpg"},{"name":"Big Hands, Big Grave.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/9ea0af05de997044818555efb52478da755af83b.jpg"},{"name":"French Revolution.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/23c0d603ab10b778d563008e56eb568e8971597b.jpg"},{"name":"Never gonna give you up!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/18163dc453e050c1c69897889f8dbdea4eff8336.jpg"},{"name":"Jungian Psychology","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/500011c7a9925bc59d77af379d6f946e6b2b7f3c.jpg"},{"name":"I\u2019m perfect as it is.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/6927d8fd4c20088df5645db31975f4b3485b34ab.jpg"},{"name":"Hacker?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/e809706a75cd989987a48a91dd1c7cc6d9cafee7.jpg"},{"name":"Aching Ear.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/26d9fb97ae9b904d4f6bcdfe8a179954906d3172.jpg"},{"name":"I am Voidborn.","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3166200/c661fabcb9fdd0164731488d56f98fcbf3001d61.jpg"}],"total":10},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3166200?t=1730137240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1730137240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/9df0193576a11315612aca3cdac35e4a33737712/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1730137240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/9df0193576a11315612aca3cdac35e4a33737712/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1730137240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3215020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Explosive_Combat.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Enemy_as_weapon_GIF_optimized.gif?t=1730137240\" />In In this 2D pixel art hack-n-slash, your enemies aren't just obstacles\u2014they're your weapons! Toss explosive foes into the fray to create chaotic chain reactions and take out multiple enemies at once. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Power_up___Progress.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Upgrade_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />The further you go, the stronger you get! Collect power-ups and upgrades to enhance your character's abilities, giving you a better shot at reaching new levels of chaos. How far can you push your luck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Bosses_with_a_Twist.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Boss_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />Test your skills against a series of entertaining and funny bosses. Each boss provides a unique challenge, designed to push your abilities while keeping the action light-hearted and fun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Quirky_Characters.png?t=1730137240\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Dialogue_GIF.gif?t=1730137240\" />Encounter a cast of eccentric characters, each with their own unique personalities. Whether they\u2019re helping or hindering you, these characters add a dash of humor and unpredictability to your journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3166200/extras/Header_-_Laugh_out_loud.png?t=1730137240\" />With its comical twist on traditional action games, this game doesn\u2019t take itself too seriously. Expect plenty of laughs as you navigate through its explosive, unpredictable world.</p>","developers":["Pixel Hound Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"descri